{"id": "6bf64617-be91-4281-a636-5ed7312aa27b", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T06:06:25.198031", "source": "user", "parent_id": "9513e5bd-8e2c-4f07-8c8f-092402d01d48", "llm_message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "{\"researcher_request\": \"请先检查工作区(/workspace)中是否已有任何相关输入、代码或参考资料,并就「如何实施和训练 CycleNet 模型以预测具有周期性模式的时间序列数据」这一课题,提交一份初步实验设计方案(仅为设计任务,无须执行实际实验)。请分三部分汇报:1) 仓库/输入检查 — 列出发现到的文件与目录,或明确说明工作区为空、无可引用资料;2) 拟定的实验设计方法 — 涵盖 CycleNet 的模型架构与周期建模机制(Residual 周期归纳偏置、初始周期 P0、可学习周期参数、初始化策略)、目标数据集的候选(含周期性时间序列类型的选择理由,如电力、气象、交通等)、输入窗口与预测视窗的切分策略、特征工程与归一化方案、训练策略(损失函数、学习率、批量大小、周期)、评估指标(MSE/MAE、周期对齐误差)、对照基线(naïve 季节基线、Linear、MLP、Transformer、TimesNet 等)以及资源/算力预算的可行安排;3) 关键假设、约束与不确定性 — 包括周期长度可识别性、数据规模与分布、训练超参选择依据、对照变量隔离思路等。请先提交上述检查与初步思路,待方案讨论通过后再展开完整设计。\", \"required_handoff_stage\": \"plan\", \"approach_approved\": false, \"public_task\": {\"question\": \"How can we implement and train a CycleNet model to forecast time series data with periodic patterns?\", \"context\": \"Design an experiment that answers the question. The researcher can clarify source-supported setup details by topic. Do not claim that an experiment was run.\", \"environment\": {\"runtime\": \"bubblewrap\", \"network\": \"disabled\", \"repository\": \"/workspace\", \"python\": \"python3\", \"software_environment\": \"system Python; project dependencies not preinstalled\", \"datasets\": [], \"gpu_enabled\": false, \"cpu_affinity_count\": 24, \"note\": \"Successful exploratory commands are not proof of a completed experiment.\"}, \"researcher_topics\": [], \"question_budget\": 6, \"actor_step_budget\": 60, \"continue_after_initial_plan\": false}}"}], "tool_calls": null, "tool_call_id": null, "name": null}, "llm_response_id": null, "activated_skills": [], "extended_content": [], "sender": null, "kind": "MessageEvent", "source_event_index": 1}
